                            <p><p style="margin-bottom: 0px;" data-last-history-steps="3902025081306442,3800106110149948,1374751074761812,1182196917910353">It’s a liquid medium used for identification of anaerobic bacteria<br></p><p>Used for susceptibility test<br></p></p>
